                "description": "The Georgetown Crystal Knob with Small Palladian Plate features classic shapes that make this knobset a great addition to historic homes. The Georgetown Knob is made out of clear crystal. The Georgetown Crystal Knob with Palladian Interior Plate will fit most pre-drilled doors. Choose your favorite finish color for the rose.",
